    },
    {
      "name": "dryRun",
      "position": "Query",
      "type": "Boolean",
      "required": false,
      "description": {
        "zh": "是否只预检此次请求，取值含义如下：\n\n- true：发送检查请求，不会创建终端节点。检查项包括AccessKey是否有效、RAM用户的授权情况和是否填写了必需参数。\n- false（默认值）：立即触发创建终端节点。",
        "en": "Specifies whether to perform a dry run. Valid values:\n\n- true: Performs a dry run. The system checks if your AccessKey is valid, if the Resource Access Management (RAM) user is authorized, and if all required parameters are specified. The request is not sent.\n\n- false (default): Sends the request to update the experiment."
      }
    },
    {
